 Azure AI Agentsek ("last" és "bibi")

A két Azure agent — last v3 és bibi v3 — speciális feladatokra van optimalizálva. Ezeket a Replit backendről hívod DefaultAzureCredentiallal, amit Replit Secretsben tárolt environment variableökkel old meg (AZURE_CLIENT_ID, AZURE_CLIENT_SECRET, AZURE_TENANT_ID).

typescript
// lib/azure-agents.ts
import { exec } from "child_process";
import { promisify } from "util";

const execAsync = promisify(exec);

export async function callAzureAgent(
  agentName: "last" | "bibi",
  userMessage: string
): Promise<string> {
  // Python subprocess hívás az azure SDK-val
  const script = `
import asyncio
from azure.identity import DefaultAzureCredential
from azure.ai.projects import AIProjectClient

client = AIProjectClient(
    endpoint="https://ceo-resource.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/ceo",
    credential=DefaultAzureCredential(),
)
openai_client = client.get_openai_client()
response = openai_client.responses.create(
    input=[{"role": "user", "content": """${userMessage.replace(/"/g, '\\"')}"""}],
    extra_body={"agent_reference": {"name": "${agentName}", "version": "3", "type": "agent_reference"}},
)
print(response.output_text)
  `;

  const { stdout } = await execAsync(`python3 -c '${script}'`);
  return stdout.trim();
}




 Daytona Sandbox — AI Computer Funkció

A Daytona.io sandboxok a "Computer" funkció szíve: itt fut a kód izoláltan, böngészhet, fájlokat kezelhet, terminált futtathat.  Ez a Perplexity Computer megfelelője.[1]

typescript
// lib/daytona.ts
const DAYTONA_API = "https://app.daytona.io/api";

export async function createSandbox(language: "python" | "typescript" | "bash") {
  const resp = await fetch(`${DAYTONA_API}/workspaces`, {
    method: "POST",
    headers: {
      "Authorization": `Bearer ${process.env.DAYTONA_API_KEY}`,
      "Content-Type": "application/json",
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({
      name: `sandbox-${Date.now()}`,
      image: language === "python" ? "python:3.12" : "node:22",
      resources: { cpu: 4, memory: 8192 },
    }),
  });
  return resp.json();
}

export async function executeCode(workspaceId: string, code: string) {
  const resp = await fetch(`${DAYTONA_API}/workspaces/${workspaceId}/execute`, {
    method: "POST",
    headers: {
      "Authorization": `Bearer ${process.env.DAYTONA_API_KEY}`,
      "Content-Type": "application/json",
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({ command: code }),
  });
  return resp.json();
}




