 Modal SelfHost — GLM5 B200on

Ha saját GPUn akarod futtatni a teljes 744B modellt (ehhez kell a B200 8×GPU), a Modal workeren quantizálva is elfér:[7][2]

python
# modal_workers/glm5_inference.py
import modal

app = modal.App("glm5-self-hosted")

image = modal.Image.debian_slim().pip_install(
    "vllm>=0.7.0", "transformers", "torch", "huggingface_hub"
)

@app.cls(
    gpu="B200:8",   # 8× B200 — a teljes 744B-hez kell
    image=image,
    secrets=[modal.Secret.from_name("api-keys")],
    timeout=600,
    container_idle_timeout=300,
)
class GLM5Server:
    @modal.enter()
    def load_model(self):
        from vllm import LLM, SamplingParams
        self.llm = LLM(
            model="zai-org/GLM-5",
            tensor_parallel_size=8,
            max_model_len=200000,
            dtype="bfloat16",
        )

    @modal.web_endpoint(method="POST")
    def generate(self, request: dict):
        from vllm import SamplingParams
        params = SamplingParams(
            temperature=0.7,
            max_tokens=request.get("max_tokens", 8192),
        )
        outputs = self.llm.generate(request["prompt"], params)
        return {"text": outputs[0].outputs[0].text}


A GLM5 tehát minden rétegen be van kötve: FriendliAI Serverless (leggyorsabb, legolcsóbb), Z.ai direkt API (fallback), TensorMesh (extra routing), és opcionálisan Modal B200on selfhosztolva a maximális kontroll érdekében.[1][5][2]
